OL,3,AInterest rates expected to rise for
OL,4,Afirst time in over three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolicymakers at the Bank of England are
OL,7,Fexpected to raise interest rates on
OL,8,FThursday in what would be the first
OL,9,Fincrease to the benchmark rate for more
OL,10,Fthan three years.
OL,12,FMost analysts are predicting a rise
OL,13,Ffrom 3.75% to 4% in a move that would
OL,14,Fincrease the cost of borrowing for
OL,15,Findividuals and businesses, but boost
OL,16,Fsavers.
OL,18,FThe Bank rate has fallen from its
OL,19,F2023-24 peak of 5.25%, although the
OL,20,FBank's Monetary Policy Committee (MPC)
OL,21,Fhas left the rate unchanged at its last
OL,22,Fsix meetings.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
