OL,3,AInterest rates expected to rise for
OL,4,Afirst time in over three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising inflation, driven primarily by
OL,7,Fthe cost of petrol and diesel, will
OL,8,Fpush policymakers into an interest rate
OL,9,Fhike, analysts suggest.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
